SciFact public training excerpt

Source: David Wadden, Shanchuan Lin, Kyle Lo, Lucy Lu Wang, Madeleine van Zuylen,
Arman Cohan, and Hannaneh Hajishirzi. Fact or Fiction: Verifying Scientific Claims.
EMNLP 2020. https://github.com/allenai/scifact

Data archive: https://scifact.s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/release/latest/data.tar.gz
Archive SHA256: 11c621288d41ac144d29b13b0f8503b3820b7d6e8b1f6ff24dff335c196d76be

