Scientific abstract database (S2ORC): ODC-By 1.0
https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/by/1-0/

This file contains attribution for the selected original public training claims,
abstracts, and evidence annotations in scifact-train-sample.json. The diagnostic
is independent of the competition evaluation workload. The sample preserves
original claim and document identifiers and original title/abstract text.
Evidence offsets were derived from the annotated original abstract sentences;
two distractors per claim were selected by query-word overlap and document order
was rotated. No source evidence was paraphrased. This is not an endorsement by
the original authors. The product's src/ implementation never reads this data.
